A||||9||fogglethorpe||Wedding bells in Bimplerville||||1||
Z||000000||fogglethorpe||09-01-2001||07:13 PM||||story by Cyrus Scoopluterman<P>--Bimplerville...Biff and Libby Wifferdiffis are pleased to announce the engagement of their daughter, Cybill Wifferdiffis, to Basil Frazzlebaffer, son of Axel and Harriet Frazzlebaffer of the Lower East end of Upper Mochahonker Falls.<BR>   The ceremony will occur on Friday, October 28, at 6pm, at Our Lady of Perpetual Perpetualness Church, on the corner of Squat and Grinksberry. The Reverend Chet Weckerfletz will officiate.<BR>   A reception will follow at 9pm at Smaggleflap's Banquet Hall, on Spazlorder Boulevard.<BR>   Mr. Frazzlebaffer is a junior partner at Shinebinder, Swingdingle, and Borgslap, CPAs.<BR>   Ms. Wifferdiffis is a secretary at the Law Firm of Bozo & Goofus, and currently pursuing a law degree.<BR>   Rube Flubedoogler from nearby Spirklurker and a close friend of the Groom-to-be, will be best man.<BR>   The Bride-to-be has chosen Cindy McWinderblinton, a cousin from Blaffwinkerville.<BR>   Many local businesses are involved in the celebration, among them:<BR>   Millie Frillpilfer Bridals<BR>   Binglingster Limousine service<BR>   Hardartery & Fatsnacker Catering<BR>   Mungerlip and Soggwoller Florals<BR>   and<BR>   special music by Will Spillfinster's Pinstriped Minstrels.<BR>   <BR>   A two week honeymoon trip to "Last Resort" is planned.<BR>   <BR>   ||||reg||1
